  "releaseNotes": "RELEASE NOTES:\n=================\nThe UI library for building fast and beautiful WinForms apps in C#, VB.NET and Visual Studio IDE.\n\n* IMPORTANT PLEASE READ:\n- Back up all your projects BEFORE updating.\n- Read about the changes, enhancements and improvements BEFORE updating.\n- Contact us if you have any questions BEFORE updating your library.\n------------------------------\n\nENHANCED COMPONENTS:\n\n# Siticone Image Button\n# Siticone Button\n\n\n🔥NEW COMPONENTS:\n\n# Siticone Text Box Advanced\n# Siticone Button Advanced\n# Siticone ToggleButton Advanced\n# Siticone Dashboard Button Advanced\n# Siticone Message Box\n# Siticone Super Progress Bar\n# Siticone Super Circle ProgressBar\n# Siticone Circular Step Tracker\n# Siticone Circular Resource Monitor\n# Siticone Circular Battery Indicator\n# Siticone Circular Timer Control\n# Siticone Circular Skill Meter\n# Siticone Circular Progress Meter\n# Siticone Spectrum Meter\n# Siticone Fluid Canvas\n# Siticone Tree View\n# Siticone Circular Progress\n# Siticone Halo Gauge\n# Siticone Radial Gauge\n# Siticone Supercar Gauge\n# Siticone Velocity Gauge\n# Siticone Orbit Gauge\n# Siticone Spectrum Gauge\n# Siticone Circuit Gauge\n# Siticone Prism Speed Gauge\n# Siticone Neon Speed Gauge\n# Siticone Industrial Gauge\n# Siticone Analog Gauge\n# Siticone Liquid Gauge\n# Siticone Circular Gauge\n# Siticone Arc Cluster Gauge\n# Siticone Linear Gauge\n# Siticone Neon Velocity Gauge\n# Siticone Modern Circular Gauge\n# Siticone Progress Gauge\n# Siticone Advanced Linear Gauge\n# Siticone Super Radial Gauge\n# Siticone Quantix Gauge\n# Siticone Clean Radial Gauge\n# Siticone Radial Flow Gauge",
